{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>屯門公眾游泳池有人暈倒，不省人事。今日（19日）傍晚5時59分，警方接獲報案，指青松觀路37號賽馬會仁愛堂游泳池，有一名女子在更衣室內暈倒。</p><p>救援人員趕至，發現女事主仍陷昏迷，遂將她送往屯門醫院搶救。據了解，女事主暈倒前疑曾游泳，警方正調查事主暈倒原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"一名女子在賽馬會仁愛堂游泳池的更衣室內暈倒，昏迷送院搶救。（Google Maps截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188927032977788928784523.png/TEreN3AF5fKLOfMa_fTUp8sb6OldoY8yaIsEFWiLBBU\"/><figcaption>一名女子在賽馬會仁愛堂游泳池的更衣室內暈倒，昏迷送院搶救。（Google Maps截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主被送往屯門醫院搶救。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1156907447559000064023786.jpeg/nVIlcnDaIqrAgke38emFrSBL53nDAn_8D6MqNA-jKjQ\"/><figcaption>事主被送往屯門醫院搶救。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T11:19:13.977536+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T11:14:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T12:57:38.829866+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T11:17:35.569195+00:00","content_hash":"130ef321555dff0fbea0040cdb65c4099ffc7f29ffd0bb5044e3fb07a2cbc027","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}